<title>UK: DNIB sets 10 billion peseta three-year bond.</title>
<headline>DNIB sets 10 billion peseta three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Banco Central Hispano SA and UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DE NATIONALE INVESTERINGSBANKEN</p>
<p> AMT    10 BLN ESP    COUPON     5.10	MATURITY    24.FEB.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.88    PAY DATE    24.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.50	LISTING    AIAF	PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA3/AA+   DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    SPANISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  1.0	 PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
